Hide On
Screen Open 0,320,120,4,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0 : Palette $000,$F00,$0F0,$00F
Ink 1 : Bar 0,0 To 99,119 : Ink 2 : Bar 100,0 To 199,119 : Ink 3 : Bar 200,0 To 319,119
Screen Open 1,320,80,4,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0 : Palette $000,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F : Screen Display 1,,180,,
Ink 1 : Bar 0,0 To 159,79 : Ink 2 : Bar 160,0 To 319,79
Set Rainbow 0,1,64,"(4,1,15)","(2,2,15)","(8,1,15)",$000
Set Rainbow 1,0,100,"(1,1,15)","","(2,-1,15)",$00F
Set Rainbow 2,2,40,"","(1,1,15)","",$080
Rainbow 0,0,60,80 : Rainbow 1,10,170,90 : Rainbow 2,5,200,60
Wait Vbl : Wait Vbl : Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/s1" : Close 9 : Clear Key : Repeat : Wait Vbl : Until Inkey$<>""
Rainbow 0,20,40,40 : Rainbow 2,,100,
Wait Vbl : Wait Vbl : Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/s2" : Close 9 : Clear Key : Repeat : Wait Vbl : Until Inkey$<>""
Rainbow Del 1 : Screen To Front 0
Wait Vbl : Wait Vbl : Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/s3" : Close 9 : Clear Key : Repeat : Wait Vbl : Until Inkey$<>""
Rainbow Del : Wait Vbl : Wait Vbl
Wait Vbl : Wait Vbl : Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/s4" : Close 9 : Clear Key : Repeat : Wait Vbl : Until Inkey$<>""
Print #1,"end"
